Cell["\<\
The flavour-symmetry functions are prepared to handle tree-level results \
only. The user is warned of it if a 1-loop result is fed.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.907394186651312*^9, 3.907394226595334*^9}, {
  3.9618115093157578`*^9, 
  3.9618115145790176`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"aa22fd97-325c-4138-aa87-\
62e5546b0a60"],

